{"v":4,"catch":"Head Over Heels 是一款經典遊戲，以精美的高分辨率像素藝術和美妙的原聲帶重新想像！","desc":"Head over Heels 是一款等距解謎/平台遊戲，其中有兩個可玩角色，頭和腳後跟被抓獲、分開並被囚禁在城堡中。\n\nHead 可以射擊敵人來解決謎題，只要他收集了足夠的甜甜圈彈藥來解決這個問題，並且跳得比 Heels 更高，這會更快，並且在遊戲早期就可以在一個屏幕內攜帶單個物體。\n\n玩家必須使用並結合他們所有的力量，才能讓他們離開城堡並完成前面的所有謎題。","publisher":"Atari","release":"2021-10-28","genres":["街機","動作","冒險","益智"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.3GB / Switch 0.3GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c7db0c706014125a8e86ed1149b49532c59b52d18916bf8e226170f5715463f9.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/29585f5d6937e83915d098e90570c3107e1723459957f49403896c5a2146517c.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/22bbaf5b1dc3a7b8c5f9077d1bc8f3892c0474067f6d377be3c0ad584fff09da.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/70c40f4ba87f03dc6da2227cad157d52622fa4838c6f52c294029b2662455722.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0ff5c057fea0b9121946f367b98d515d47c15ff669fba952376af10c07173007.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/140f6046dfa52e2ce19b4d50f48523344690881a59b30837241f778b3beadcb1.jpg"],"titleId":"010048a0151ca000","dlc":[]}